  <para style="s1">Triumph in Christ</para>
  <para style="p"> <verse style="v" number="12" /><char style="w" strong="G1161">Now</char> <char style="w" strong="G2064">when I went</char> <char style="w" strong="G1519">to</char> <char style="w" strong="G3588">-</char> <char style="w" strong="G5174">Troas</char> <char style="w" strong="G1519">[to preach]</char> <char style="w" strong="G3588">the</char> <char style="w" strong="G2098">gospel</char> <char style="w" strong="G3588">-</char> <char style="w" strong="G5547">of Christ</char> <char style="w" strong="G2532">and</char> <char style="w" strong="G2374">a door</char> <char style="w" strong="G455">stood open</char> <char style="w" strong="G1473">for me</char> <char style="w" strong="G1722">in</char> <char style="w" strong="G2962">[the] Lord</char>, <verse style="v" number="13" /><char style="w" strong="G2192">I had</char> <char style="w" strong="G3756">no</char> <char style="w" strong="G425">peace</char> <char style="w" strong="G3588">in</char> <char style="w" strong="G1473">my</char> <char style="w" strong="G4151">spirit</char>, <char style="w" strong="G1473">[because] I</char> <char style="w" strong="G3588">-</char> <char style="w" strong="G3361">vvv</char> <char style="w" strong="G2147">did not find</char> <char style="w" strong="G1473">my</char> <char style="w" strong="G3588">-</char> <char style="w" strong="G80">brother</char> <char style="w" strong="G5103">Titus [there]</char>. <char style="w" strong="G235">[So]</char> <char style="w" strong="G657">I said goodbye</char> <char style="w" strong="G846">to them</char> <char style="w" strong="G1831">[and] went on</char> <char style="w" strong="G1519">to</char> <char style="w" strong="G3109">Macedonia</char>.</para>
  <para style="p"> <verse style="v" number="14" /><char style="w" strong="G1161">But</char> <char style="w" strong="G5485">thanks [be]</char> <char style="w" strong="G3588">to</char> <char style="w" strong="G2316">God</char>, <char style="w" strong="G3588">who</char> <char style="w" strong="G3842">always</char> <char style="w" strong="G2358">leads us triumphantly as captives</char> <char style="w" strong="G1473">. . .</char> <char style="w" strong="G1722">in</char> <char style="w" strong="G3588">-</char> <char style="w" strong="G5547">Christ</char> <char style="w" strong="G2532">and</char> <char style="w" strong="G1223">through</char> <char style="w" strong="G1473">us</char> <char style="w" strong="G5319">spreads</char> <char style="w" strong="G1722">vvv</char> <char style="w" strong="G3956">vvv</char> <char style="w" strong="G5117">everywhere</char> <char style="w" strong="G3588">the</char> <char style="w" strong="G3744">fragrance</char> <char style="w" strong="G3588">of</char> <char style="w" strong="G1108">[the] knowledge</char> <char style="w" strong="G846">of Him</char>. <verse style="v" number="15" /><char style="w" strong="G3754">For</char> <char style="w" strong="G1510">we are</char> <char style="w" strong="G3588">-</char> <char style="w" strong="G2316">to God</char> <char style="w" strong="G2175">[the] sweet aroma</char> <char style="w" strong="G5547">of Christ</char> <char style="w" strong="G1722">among</char> <char style="w" strong="G3588">those who are</char> <char style="w" strong="G4982">being saved</char> <char style="w" strong="G2532">and</char> <char style="w" strong="G1722">-</char> <char style="w" strong="G3588">those who are</char> <char style="w" strong="G622">perishing</char>. <verse style="v" number="16" /><char style="w" strong="G3739">To [the] one</char> <char style="w" strong="G3303">[we are]</char> <char style="w" strong="G3744">an odor</char> <char style="w" strong="G1537">that brings</char> <char style="w" strong="G2288">death</char> <ch