  <para style="s1">Ambassadors for Christ</para>
  <para style="p"> <verse style="v" number="11" /><char style="w" strong="G3767">Therefore</char>, <char style="w" strong="G1492">since we know</char> <char style="w" strong="G3588">[what it means]</char> <char style="w" strong="G5401">to fear</char> <char style="w" strong="G3588">the</char> <char style="w" strong="G2962">Lord</char>, <char style="w" strong="G3982">we try to persuade</char> <char style="w" strong="G444">men</char>. <char style="w" strong="G1161">-</char> <char style="w" strong="G5319">What we are is clear</char> <char style="w" strong="G2316">to God</char>, <char style="w" strong="G1161">and</char> <char style="w" strong="G1679">I hope</char> <char style="w" strong="G5319">it is clear</char> <char style="w" strong="G1722">to</char> <char style="w" strong="G4771">your</char> <char style="w" strong="G3588">-</char> <char style="w" strong="G4893">conscience</char> <char style="w" strong="G2532">as well</char>. <verse style="v" number="12" /><char style="w" strong="G3756">vvv</char> <char style="w" strong="G4921">We are not commending</char> <char style="w" strong="G1438">ourselves</char> <char style="w" strong="G4771">to you</char> <char style="w" strong="G3825">again</char>. <char style="w" strong="G235">Instead</char>, <char style="w" strong="G1325">we are giving</char> <char style="w" strong="G4771">you</char> <char style="w" strong="G874">an occasion</char> <char style="w" strong="G2745">to be proud</char> <char style="w" strong="G5228">of</char> <char style="w" strong="G1473">us</char>, <char style="w" strong="G2443">so that</char> <char style="w" strong="G2192">you can answer</char> <char style="w" strong="G4314">. . .</char> <char style="w" strong="G3588">those who</char> <char style="w" strong="G2744">take pride</char> <char style="w" strong="G1722">in</char> <char style="w" strong="G4383">appearances</char> <char style="w" strong="G2532">[rather than]</char> <char style="w" strong="G3361">. . .</char> <char style="w" strong="G1722">in</char> <