  <para style="p"> <verse style="v" number="1" /><char style="w" strong="G1063">Now</char> <char style="w" strong="G3303">. . .</char> <char style="w" strong="G4012">about</char> <char style="w" strong="G3588">the</char> <char style="w" strong="G1248">service</char> <char style="w" strong="G3588">-</char> <char style="w" strong="G1519">to</char> <char style="w" strong="G3588">the</char> <char style="w" strong="G40">saints</char>, <char style="w" strong="G1510">there is</char> <char style="w" strong="G4053">no need</char> <char style="w" strong="G1473">for me</char> <char style="w" strong="G3588">-</char> <char style="w" strong="G1125">to write</char> <char style="w" strong="G4771">to you</char>. <verse style="v" number="2" /><char style="w" strong="G1063">For</char> <char style="w" strong="G1492">I know</char> <char style="w" strong="G4771">your</char> <char style="w" strong="G3588">-</char> <char style="w" strong="G4288">eagerness [to help]</char>, <char style="w" strong="G3739">[and]</char> <char style="w" strong="G2744">I have been boasting</char> <char style="w" strong="G3110">to [the] Macedonians</char> <char style="w" strong="G3754">that</char> <char style="w" strong="G575">since</char> <char style="w" strong="G4070">last year</char> <char style="w" strong="G5228">-</char> <char style="w" strong="G4771">you</char> <char style="w" strong="G882">in Achaia</char> <char style="w" strong="G3903">were prepared [ to give ]</char>. <char style="w" strong="G2532">And</char> <char style="w" strong="G4771">your</char> <char style="w" strong="G3588">-</char> <char style="w" strong="G2205">zeal</char> <char style="w" strong="G2042">has stirred</char> <char style="w" strong="G3588">-</char> <char style="w" strong="G4119">most of them [ to do likewise ]</char>.</para>
