  <para style="s1">Paul’s Concern for the Corinthians</para>
  <para style="p"> <verse style="v" number="11" /><char style="w" strong="G1096">I have become</char> <char style="w" strong="G878">a fool</char>, <char style="w" strong="G4771">[but] you</char> <char style="w" strong="G315">drove</char> <char style="w" strong="G1473">me [to it]</char>. <char style="w" strong="G1063">In fact</char>, <char style="w" strong="G5259">-</char> <char style="w" strong="G4771">you</char> <char style="w" strong="G3784">should</char> <char style="w" strong="G4921">have commended</char> <char style="w" strong="G1473">me</char>, <char style="w" strong="G1063">since</char> <char style="w" strong="G3762">vvv</char> <char style="w" strong="G5302">I am in no way inferior</char> <char style="w" strong="G3588">to those</char> “<char style="w" strong="G5228">super-apostles</char> <char style="w" strong="G652">. . .</char>,” <char style="w" strong="G2532">even</char> <char style="w" strong="G1487">though</char> <char style="w" strong="G1510">I am</char> <char style="w" strong="G3762">nothing</char>. <verse style="v" number="12" /><char style="w" strong="G3588">The</char> <char style="w" strong="G4592">marks</char> <char style="w" strong="G3588">of a</char> <char style="w" strong="G3303">true</char> <char style="w" strong="G652">apostle</char> — <char style="w" strong="G4592">signs</char>, <char style="w" strong="G5037">-</char> <char style="w" strong="G2532">-</char> <char style="w" strong="G5059">wonders</char>, <char style="w" strong="G2532">and</char> <char style="w" strong="G1411">miracles</char> — <char style="w" strong="G2716">were performed</char> <char style="w" strong="G1722">among</char> <char style="w" strong="G4771">you</char> <char style="w" strong="G1722">with</char> <char style="w" strong="G3956">great</char> <char style="w" strong="G5281">perseverance</char>. <verse style="v" number="13" /><char style="w" strong="G1063">-</char> <char style="w" strong="G5101">In what way</char> <char style="w" strong="G1510">. . .</char> <char style="w"