  <para style="p"> <verse style="v" number="16" /><char style="w" strong="G1161">-</char> <char style="w" strong="G1510">Be that as it may</char>, <char style="w" strong="G1473">I</char> <char style="w" strong="G3756">vvv</char> <char style="w" strong="G2599">was not a burden</char> <char style="w" strong="G4771">to you</char>; <char style="w" strong="G235">but</char> <char style="w" strong="G3835">crafty</char> <char style="w" strong="G5225">as I am</char>, <char style="w" strong="G2983">I caught</char> <char style="w" strong="G4771">you</char> <char style="w" strong="G1388">by trickery</char>. <verse style="v" number="17" /><char style="w" strong="G3361">vvv</char> <char style="w" strong="G4122">Did I exploit</char> <char style="w" strong="G4771">you</char> <char style="w" strong="G1223">by</char> <char style="w" strong="G846">-</char> <char style="w" strong="G5100">anyone</char> <char style="w" strong="G3739">-</char> <char style="w" strong="G649">I sent</char> <char style="w" strong="G4314">-</char> <char style="w" strong="G4771">you</char>? <verse style="v" number="18" /><char style="w" strong="G3870">I urged</char> <char style="w" strong="G5103">Titus [to visit you]</char>, <char style="w" strong="G2532">and</char> <char style="w" strong="G4882">I sent</char> <char style="w" strong="G3588">[our]</char> <char style="w" strong="G80">brother [with him]</char>. <char style="w" strong="G5103">{Did} Titus</char> <char style="w" strong="G4122">exploit</char> <char style="w" strong="G4771">you</char> <char style="w" strong="G3385">[in any way]</char>? <char style="w" strong="G3756">vvv</char> <char style="w" strong="G4043">Did we not walk</char> <char style="w" strong="G3588">in the</char> <char style="w" strong="G846">same</char> <char style="w" strong="G4151">Spirit</char> <char style="w" strong="G3756">[and follow]</char> <char style="w" strong="G3588">in the</char> <char style="w" strong="G846">same</char> <char style="w" strong="G2487">footsteps</char>?<note styl