  <para style="p"> <verse style="v" number="19" /><char style="w" strong="G1380">Have you been thinking</char> <char style="w" strong="G3819">all along</char> <char style="w" strong="G3754">that</char> <char style="w" strong="G626">we were making a defense</char> <char style="w" strong="G4771">to you</char>? <char style="w" strong="G2980">We speak</char> <char style="w" strong="G2713">before</char> <char style="w" strong="G2316">God</char> <char style="w" strong="G1722">in</char> <char style="w" strong="G5547">Christ</char>, <char style="w" strong="G1161">and</char> <char style="w" strong="G3956">all</char> <char style="w" strong="G3588">of [this]</char>, <char style="w" strong="G27">beloved</char>, <char style="w" strong="G5228">[is]</char> <char style="w" strong="G4771">vvv</char> <char style="w" strong="G3588">vvv</char> <char style="w" strong="G3619">to build you up</char>. <verse style="v" number="20" /><char style="w" strong="G1063">For</char> <char style="w" strong="G5399">I am afraid</char> <char style="w" strong="G3361">[that]</char> <char style="w" strong="G2064">when I come</char>, <char style="w" strong="G4459">vvv</char> <char style="w" strong="G3756">vvv</char> <char style="w" strong="G2147">I may not find</char> <char style="w" strong="G4771">you</char> <char style="w" strong="G3634">as</char> <char style="w" strong="G2309">I wish</char>, <char style="w" strong="G2504">and</char> <char style="w" strong="G4771">you</char> <char style="w" strong="G2147">may not find {me}</char> <char style="w" strong="G3756">. . .</char> <char style="w" strong="G3634">as</char> <char style="w" strong="G2309">you wish</char>. <char style="w" strong="G3361">[I fear]</char> <char style="w" strong="G4459">that there may be</char> <char style="w" strong="G2054">quarreling</char>, <char style="w" strong="G2205">jealousy</char>, <char style="w" strong="G2372">rage</char>, <char style="w" strong="G2052">rivalry</char>, <char style="w" strong="G2636">slander</char>, <char style=